 "description": {
  "en": "Chessboards, draughts boards and any n × m board: dark squares filled, hatched, crossed or as a small checkerboard, with coordinates on the border.",
  "de": "Schachbretter, Damebretter und beliebige n × m Bretter: dunkle Felder gefüllt, schraffiert, gekreuzt oder als kleines Schachbrett, mit Koordinaten am Rand.",
  "it": "Scacchiere, damiere e qualsiasi tavoliere n × m: caselle scure piene, tratteggiate, incrociate o come piccola scacchiera, con coordinate sul bordo."
 },
